.TH WFAS 1 "2026" "1.2.0" "WiFi Audio Streaming"
.SH NAME
wfas \- stream audio over your local network
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wfas
[\-\-gui | \-\-cli] [\-\-mode server|client|discover|rtp|snapcast] [OPTIONS]
.br
.B wfas
