.B config set <key> <value>
Change one setting and save it.
.TP
.B config path
Print the config.json path for this system. Alias: where.
.TP
.B config edit
Open config.json in your default editor. Alias: open.
.TP
.B config reset
Restore all settings to their defaults.
.TP
.B config export [file]
Write the config to a file, or to stdout if omitted. Alias: save.
